Argyle was a tall man in [[Org/Iconoclasm/index|Iconoclasm]] who smelled of frankincense and myrrh, wore armor, and carried a shield. He was a trained healer, and was a contact of [[Org/The Scale/People/Dame Quay|Dame Quay]] in [[Org/The Scale/index|the Scale]].

He was killed in the attack on the [[Org/Roundhat Gang/index|Roundhat Gang]] at [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/The Crowded Flea|the Crowded Flea]], and his soul did not return with the others; the Party dreamed of it chained between a light pulling up and a dark pulling down.
